      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Now a write. The release pipeline gets a token from Keycloak, outside the cluster, as in Episode 9."
        },
        {
          "text": "Its PUT takes exactly the same road in: DNS, a node, Traefik, the rule, the endpoints, a pod."
        },
        {
          "text": "The pod checks the token with the public keys of Keycloak. It fetched them once, over HTTPS, trusting the company root CA, and keeps them."
        },
        {
          "text": "Only then does it update the row.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.4
        }
      ]
    },
