          "text": "In Loki, the pipeline's PUT. 200 this time, because the link already existed, so it was replaced, not created."
        },
        {
          "text": "The app logged who called, from the token. And notice the pod: n4hzx, on agent 2. Traefik took turns, so this request went to the other pod.",
